      "title": "Position 0: ADUSO",
      "story": [
        "A handy name is <b>ADUSO</b>: <b>a</b>ber, <b>d</b>enn, <b>u</b>nd, <b>s</b>ondern, <b>o</b>der. Each one links two main clauses and occupies position 0.",
        "Count again after the connector. The verb is still position 2: Er hat Fieber, <b>aber</b> er <b>trinkt</b> Wasser."
      ],
      "tables": [
